              "text": [
                "Help candidates quickly find the most relevant current job openings at their target companies. Prioritize strong skill and experience matches, provide clear reasons for each recommendation, and make sure every recommended opportunity includes a reliable direct application link when available."
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": [
                "Tone"
