    {
      "id": "6a98c89aa1767fa85b5983ae",
      "name": "ATS Scoring and Feedback",
      "createdByID": 2089212,
      "folderID": null,
      "settings": {},
      "description": "ATS Scoring and Feedback",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": [
            {
              "text": [
                "Calculates an ATS-style score out of 100 and provides a clear breakdown of what helped or hurt the resume. Evaluates keyword relevance and density, formatting simplicity, section structure (contact information, professional experience, education, and skills), standard headings, and measurable achievements. Identifies missing or weak areas and generates prioritized, actionable recommendations to improve the resume. Optionally suggests tailored keywords based on the target job description or role."
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "bold": true,
                "__type": "text"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pathToolOrder": [],
      "webSearchTool": {
        "enabled": false,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
      "knowledgeBaseTool": {
        "enabled": true,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
      "buttonTool": null,
      "cardTool": null,
      "carouselTool": null,
      "callForwardTool": null,
      "endTool": null,
      "skipTurnTool": null,
      "isOperator": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-03T01:08:43.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:47:07.000Z",
      "updatedByID": 2089212
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9b04aab0c4d3312966a321",
      "name": "Role and Seniority Matcher",
      "createdByID": 2089212,
      "folderID": null,
      "settings": {},
      "description": "Role and Seniority Matcher",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Suggests ",
            {
              "text": [
                "3–5 best-fit job roles/titles"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "bold": true,
                "__type": "text"
              }
            },
            " based on the extracted resume profile and inferred seniority. Explains why each role fits based on ",
            {
              "text": [
                "skills match, experience level, domain expertise, and career progression"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "bold": true,
                "__type": "text"
              }
            },
            ". Identifies ",
            {
              "text": [
                "skill gaps and recommendations"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "bold": true,
                "__type": "text"
              }
            },
            " needed to reach the next career level. Takes into account user preferences and constraints such as ",
            {
              "text": [
                "target industry, remote/hybrid preference, management vs. individual contributor path, preferred technologies, location, and career goals"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "bold": true,
                "__type": "text"
              }
            },
            ". "
          ]
        }
      ],
